abstract: >
  Vantis Media Player is an advanced, zero-cost architecture media player
  built entirely in Rust with GPU acceleration, AI-powered features, and
  post-quantum cryptography. It features zero-copy memory management,
  real-time AI upscaling, and a modular plugin system.
